{"id":232,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"正直礼儀で育つ帝京中高一貫教育","feature_description":"帝京中学校・高等学校は、校訓の『正直・礼儀』を基盤に、一貫進学コースと一貫特進コース、インターナショナルクラスなど多様な学びを用意しています。体験を通して『なりたい自分』を見つけ、自主的に考え行動する姿勢を育てる方針が示されています。高校進学後もコース制を維持し、学びを継続します。学校生活の導線も分かりやすく整えられています。","clubs":[{"id":5018,"name":"将棋（同好会）","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.teikyo.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"}],"profile_sources":[{"id":2896,"attribute_key":"feature_summary","source_url":"https://www.teikyo.ed.jp/junior/outline/","source_kind":"official_site","external_school_code":null,"verified_at":"2026-08-06","source_excerpt":null,"fetched_at":null,"content_hash":null,"invalidated_at":null,"priority":null},{"id":2897,"attribute_key":"feature_description","source_url":"https://www.teikyo.ed.jp/junior/outline/","source_kind":"official_site","external_school_code":null,"verified_at":"2026-08-06","source_excerpt":null,"fetched_at":null,"content_hash":null,"invalidated_at":null,"priority":null}]}
